#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/transform/index.rst:380
msgid "The transform pass that performs device kernel launch lowering."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/transform/index.rst:388
msgid ""
"Deprecation shim: ``T.clear`` + read-modify-write stores + in-place "
"``T.finalize_reducer(acc)`` become ``reducer_init``/``reducer_update``/ out-"
"of-place finalize with a fresh destination fragment. Unrecognized access "
"patterns are compile errors, never silently accepted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/transform/index.rst:393
msgid "The canonicalization pass."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/transform/index.rst:401
msgid ""
"Enforces that every ``T.alloc_reducer`` has exactly one ``T.reducer_init``, "
"updates only inside ``T.Parallel`` between init and finalize, exactly one "
"out-of-place ``T.finalize_reducer(acc, dst)``, and no ordinary reads/writes/"
"aliasing of the reducer handle."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/transform/index.rst:406
#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/transform/index.rst:426
msgid "The verification pass."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/transform/index.rst:414
msgid ""
"Runs after LayoutInference (loop layouts are read-only inputs) and "
"materializes the first-class reducer ops into ordinary fragment storage, "
"guarded read-modify-write updates, and an explicit finalize plan."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/transform/index.rst:418
msgid "The planning/materialization pass."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/transform/index.rst:434
msgid ""
"This pass unrolls loops based on configuration options including: - "
"auto_max_step: Threshold of number of steps to be automatically unrolled - "
"auto_max_depth: Maximum nested level of loops that can be automatically "
"unrolled - auto_max_extent: Maximum extent of loop that will be unrolled - "
"explicit_unroll: Whether to explicitly unroll instead of setting a pragma - "
"unroll_local_access: Whether to always unroll local access"
msgstr ""
